  "Elevate your eCommerceGo SaaS platform with the Countdown Timer Module, a dynamic tool designed to create excitement and urgency around your upcoming sales events. With this feature, admins can easily set up countdown timers for sales directly from the store settings page, enhancing customer engagement and boosting sales.": "使用倒计时器模块提升您的 eCommerceGo SaaS 平台，该模块是一个动态工具，旨在为您即将举行的销售活动营造兴奋感和紧迫感。",
